~ post_credits_epilogue
# The credits have finished. Cut to: the team walking out of Levaris's gates, the city behind them quiet under early morning light.

aegrandir: (quiet) Not every fight will end like this one, star. Remember that.

astryn: I know, Aeg.

aegrandir: I hope you do.

# They walk in silence for a moment.

novius: (glancing back at the city) Think it'll actually hold? Without him running it?

astryn: It'll hold long enough. People here know what they're capable of now.

spero: (quiet, uncharacteristically serious) Wish I'd figured that out sooner.

# Astryn glances at him, but doesn't push.

novius: (changing the subject, pulling out a folded paper) Got word from a contact this morning. There's a lead — bigger than Levaris.

astryn: How big?

novius: Capital-city big.

# The team exchanges a look.

astryn: (steady) Then that's where we go next.

aegrandir: We were never going to be done in one night, star.

astryn: I know. Wasn't expecting to be.

# They keep walking. Fade to black.

=> END

~ post_credits_epilogue_novius_intervened
[The credits have finished. Cut to: the team walking out of Levaris's gates, the city behind them quiet under early morning light.]

Astryn: (quiet, still a little unsteady) ...Thank you. Again.

Novius: You don't have to keep saying it.

Astryn: I kind of do.

Aegrandir: (gently) You made the call you believed in, star. That still counts for something — even if it didn't go the way you wanted.

Astryn: Didn't feel like much of a call. Felt like almost dying.

Aegrandir: I know. That's the part I want you to remember, too.

[They walk in silence for a moment.]

Novius: (glancing back at the city) Think it'll actually hold? Without him running it?

Astryn: It'll hold long enough. People here know what they're capable of now.

Spero: (quiet, uncharacteristically serious) Wish I'd figured that out sooner.

[Astryn glances at him, but doesn't push.]

Novius: (changing the subject, pulling out a folded paper) Got word from a contact this morning. There's a lead — bigger than Levaris.

Astryn: How big?

Novius: Capital-city big.

[The team exchanges a look.]

Astryn: (steady) Then that's where we go next.

Aegrandir: We were never going to be done in one night, star.

Astryn: I know. Wasn't expecting to be.

[They keep walking. Fade to black.]

=> END